  "surface": "product-page-optimization",
  "title": "Product Page Optimization",
  "purpose": "A/B tests of the product page. What this pipeline produces is the original plus three treatments, each a 3:2 search-results creative with different framing: privacy (free up space), duplicates, and screenshots. Apple also lets a test vary the icon, the screenshots, the previews, or the product page header; those variants are not produced here, and an icon test needs a 1024x1024 icon already inside the uploaded binary. Not available on custom product pages.",
